"Attributes:     offset: 相对 SMF 起始点的偏移 (调度时隙)。     duration: 时间片持续长度 (调度时隙)。"
"     period: 时间片重复周期 (调度时隙)。     repeat_count: 时间片重复次数。"
msgstr ""
"Attributes:     offset: Offset relative to the SMF start point (scheduling "
"time slots).     duration: Time slice duration (scheduling time slots).     "
"period: Time slice repeat period (scheduling time slots).     repeat_count: "
"Time slice repeat count."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/scheduler.py:652
msgid "计算此时间片展开后的所有绝对时间区间。"
