"multi_interval: 多级收发间隔配置。"
msgstr ""
"Attributes:     superframe: Superframe structure.     event_schedulers: "
"Event group schedulers indexed by link_id.     slot_counter: Global time "
"slot counter.     tx_rx_interval: Current transceive interval type.     "
"multi_interval: Multi-level transceive interval configuration."

